      "created_at": "2014-10-18T19:49:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My friends and I played against The Chairman the other day and we ran into a snag. Because Haka had savage mana out and used rampage to defeat all the underbosse’s and thugs, they went underneath, not allowing the allotted amount of underbosses to reach the trash to flip The Chairman. When they defeated The Operative, there were no available targets to be attacked. Does that mean the game ends in a tie, or what is the outcome of the event?</p>",
